{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"Vivica looks almost manic as she is trying to make her thoughts connect. \"Something was missing, things were going on and I couldn't figure out why but I think I have something.\" She starts pointing to her notes, the map, and drawing and pictures of Violet and other redcoats. \"Violet captured some of our own to attempt experiments on them, we don't know why. When me and El we captured by redcoats, we saw the wearfolk being experimented on as well, and Violet was there, we saw her. The biggest question was why though. Why were they experimenting so much, why on them specifically?\" She pauses \"So my question is, were our friends that were going to be taken by Violet dammed? Is that why she wanted them? Because I have a theory\" she points to the map \"The soldiers who took me and El were living in the Gazette, there were at least a hundred beds in there. They were experimenting on the wearfolk who lived in the sewers, a people who are considered dammed. Maybe that's what they were after. They were likely dammed themselves and was trying to find a way around it or something. Violet was there too, so she knows something about it for sure. It has to connect, and the fact that most of this took place in Hampstead isn't a coincidence.\" \n\nShe pauses looking at the others \"Does this make sense?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T19:03:59.767000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-29T19:04:59.595000Z","id":"870381161355030609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
